    "icon": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "description": "Applies one operation (round, scale, share of row or column total, index to base, z-score, fill, text case...) to many fields chosen by list, name pattern or type, with optional row statistics.",
    "category": "Preparation",
    "subcategory": "Formula",
    "tags": [
        "multi-field",
        "formula",
        "bulk",
        "wide data",
        "percent of total",
        "index",
        "visokio-agents"
    ],
    "introductoryText": "One operation applied to many fields, for the common cases. Typical for wide tables such as one column per month.\n\n**Choose the fields** explicitly, by a **name pattern** (a regular expression such as `2025$` or `^(Jan|Feb|Mar)`, so new columns are picked up automatically), or simply all number or text fields.\n\n**Number operations**: round, multiply, divide, add, subtract, **share of row total** (each field as a share of the selected fields' row total), **share of column total**, **index to a base field** (base = 100) or difference from it, z-score, min-max scaling, log, absolute value, floor / cap at a value, fill missing with a value, convert text to numbers.\n\n**Text operations**: upper, lower, title case, trim (and collapse spaces), add a prefix or suffix, fill missing text, length.\n\n**Replace** the fields or **add new ones** with a suffix, and optionally add **row statistics** across the selected fields: sum, mean, minimum, maximum, count, standard deviation.",
